-## 7.7 `issue_comments`
-
-- `id` uuid pk
-- `company_id` uuid fk not null
-- `issue_id` uuid fk `issues.id` not null
-- `author_agent_id` uuid fk `agents.id` null
-- `author_user_id` uuid fk `users.id` null
-- `body` text not null
-
-## 7.8 `heartbeat_runs`
-
