-│ Name: Marketing Analyst                                 │
-│ Role: marketing                                         │
-│ Reports to: CMO                                         │
-│ Budget: $100/month                                      │
-│ ...                                                     │
-└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
-```
-
-Right pane: Type, Status, Requested by, Requested at, Decided by, Decided at, Decision note. Activity timeline below.
